        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;When the girls are away, the boys will play!   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chocked full of enough fun for even the biggest of boys, this anthology contains seven sexy stories for you to enjoy. With a variety of different themes and characters to choose from, there's something for everybody, and plenty of steamy action to go around!   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy the stories, and remember: it's boys only in here.&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
